        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Definitive Commercial Agreements with MNOs Enabling Access to Key Markets and Potentially Large Number of Subscribers: We believe our definitive commercial agreements with AT&T and Verizon provide us a significant opportunity to provide SpaceMobile Service to the majority of end-users in the United States.",
        "start_character": 12306,
        "end_character": 12613
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001780312-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001780312-26-000006-34786be524fdfcd0",
        "accession_number": "0001780312-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to seeking complementary relationships with MNOs, we will also seek to sell our services on a revenue share basis to MNOs who then offer this capability directly to their customer base.",
        "start_character": 17715,
        "end_character": 17912
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001780312-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001780312-26-000006-34786be524fdfcd0",
        "accession_number": "0001780312-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we believe that the SpaceMobile Service will provide MNOs the opportunity to increase monthly average revenue per user through the sales of additional services.",
        "start_character": 27927,
        "end_character": 28100
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001780312-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001780312-26-000006-34786be524fdfcd0",
        "accession_number": "0001780312-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In some markets, we compete directly or indirectly with very small aperture terminal operators that offer communications services through private networks using very small aperture terminals or hybrid systems to target business users.",
        "start_character": 46842,
        "end_character": 47076
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001780312-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001780312-26-000006-34786be524fdfcd0",
        "accession_number": "0001780312-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "On October 8, 2025, we announced the signing of a definitive commercial agreement with Verizon to provide direct-to-cellular AST SpaceMobile service when needed for Verizon customers within the continental United States (excluding Alaska) and Hawaii starting in 2026.",
        "start_character": 9967,
        "end_character": 10234
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001780312-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001780312-26-000006-34786be524fdfcd0",
        "accession_number": "0001780312-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Prior to initiating SpaceMobile Service in each jurisdiction, we will need to obtain regulatory approvals in each jurisdiction where we would provide such service and would need to enter into commercial agreements with MNOs relating to the offering of such service in each jurisdiction.",
        "start_character": 9083,
        "end_character": 9369
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001780312-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001780312-26-000006-34786be524fdfcd0",
        "accession_number": "0001780312-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To that end, we entered into a contract with the United States Space Development Agency (“SDA”) through a prime contractor with total expected revenue of $43.0 million to provide certain testing services utilizing the initial BB satellites, an agreement directly with the United States SDA for the Europa Track 2 commercial solutions program with a total contract value of approximately $30.0 million, and an indefinite-delivery/indefinite-quantity (IDIQ) contract award on the Scalable Homeland Innovative Enterprise Layered Defense (SHIELD) program that enables us to pursue future task orders under the Missile Defense Agency’s multi-award framework.",
        "start_character": 16362,
        "end_character": 17015
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001780312-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001780312-26-000006-34786be524fdfcd0",
        "accession_number": "0001780312-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have an agreement with Vodafone to provide SpaceMobile Services to Vodafone’s end users outside of the markets covered by our agreement with SatCo.",
        "start_character": 9811,
        "end_character": 9966
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001780312-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001780312-26-000006-34786be524fdfcd0",
        "accession_number": "0001780312-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also expanding our efforts on ground infrastructure development for commercial readiness and integrating our SpaceMobile Service into the MNOs’ infrastructure to initiate commercial services.",
        "start_character": 10442,
        "end_character": 10640
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001780312-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001780312-26-000006-34786be524fdfcd0",
        "accession_number": "0001780312-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are developing a phased satellite deployment plan and corresponding commercial launch plan of the SpaceMobile Service based on targeted geographical areas to provide the SpaceMobile Service to the most commercially attractive MNO markets.",
        "start_character": 24819,
        "end_character": 25060
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001780312-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001780312-26-000006-34786be524fdfcd0",
        "accession_number": "0001780312-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are expanding our efforts on ground infrastructure development for commercial readiness and integrating our SpaceMobile Service into the MNOs’ infrastructure to initiate commercial services.",
        "start_character": 30784,
        "end_character": 30977
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001780312-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001780312-26-000006-34786be524fdfcd0",
        "accession_number": "0001780312-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our large phased array design and custom ASIC chip together with our expansive and technologically diverse intellectual property portfolio consisting of approximately 3,850 patent and patent pending claims, including innovations in the direct-to-cell satellite ecosystem from space to Earth, provide significant technological advantages to provide superior coverage and deliver high speed Cellular Broadband versus other direct to device satellite services.",
